{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine and Conquer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ComboSmith is a Multiplayer FPS with many mechanics along with it. You can play with up to 10 people in one lobby. Play with random people in public lobbies, or go head to head with your friends. Combine your weapons and ruin your friendships in the many maps supplied to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074240/extras/030622f967e331e578f56b6db8ae59ee.avif?t=1766787260\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The way ComboSmith came to be!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idea of ComboSmith came to me when I was helping code another game, where I thought of being able to combine your weapons in tiers in order to make stronger weapons. This idea has Flourished into ComboSmith's main feature, where after time in a match, you can combine weapons and make new combo's</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074240/extras/0095f5dfcf3757a2d44715928d84425e.avif?t=1766787260\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In ComboSmith, you can,</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on many maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wear many cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with other players in publicly made lobbies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game gets worked on more, this list will largen, So, from the ComboSmith team, Go out there, win some games, and most importantly...<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074240/extras/5ece6eac6d1157fa5f61f4312f99ec3a.av